                "capability": "document.read_section",
                "tool": "read_section",
                "content_excerpt": "## Inference Runtime Abstraction\n\nPhase-2A is now framed as an inference runtime abstraction layer, not only an\nLMF-to-vLLM migration.\n\n```text\nCognitive Runtime Freeze\n  -> ModelBackend Contract\n  -> Inference Runtime Abstraction\n  -> Replaceable Backend\n```\n\nCurrent roadmap:\n\n- Phase-2A.1: Inference Trace Layer\n- Phase-2A.2: Backend / artifact equivalence experiments\n- Phase-2B: additional inference backends such as TensorRT-LLM, SGLang, or\n  external API adapters\n\nSee `docs/inference-trace-layer-design.md` and\n`docs/phase2a-equivalence-matrix.md`.\n\nTrace output can be enabled in the inference benchmark entry points with\n`--trace-output`, which writes append-only JSONL records outside the frozen\nPhase-1 Runtime.\n",
                "content_length": 724
              }
            }
          ]
